งานวิจัย: Quantitative study for applying prospect-refuge theory on perceived safety in Al-Azhar Park, Egypt (2021) https://doi.org/10.1016/j.asej.2021.04.016
งานวิจัย: ‘Being’ in Al-Azhar Park: Public Spaces in Cairo (2013) https://doi.org/10.2174/1874942901306010065
