งานวิจัย: Cultural ecosystem services and sense of place: post-rehabilitation assessment of Wadi Hanifah's performance from a socio-cultural lens (2025) https://doi.org/10.1080/17549175.2025.2607109
งานวิจัย: Integrated water quality dynamics in Wadi Hanifah: Physical, chemical, and biological perspectives (2024) https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0298200
